/Title (Day 6 focused on application validation, code review, and refactoring. The MERN  application developed during previous sessions was successfully reviewed, including React Hooks, API communication, database integration, production build validation, and endpoint refactoring. The evaluation improved understanding of application architecture and strengthened the ability to explain and adapt existing code effectively.)
